00:03:18.889 --> 00:03:21.625
THIS MONTH OF SEPTEMBER 11TH.

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:22.693
TERRORIST ATTACKS, TO REMEMBER

00:03:22.693 --> 00:03:24.862
THE LIVES OF INNOCENT AMERICANS

00:03:24.862 --> 00:03:27.598
WHO WE LOST THAT MORNING IN

00:03:27.598 --> 00:03:29.833
2001. AMERICAN FLIGHTS.

00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:31.185
AMERICAN AIRLINES FLIGHT 11

00:03:31.185 --> 00:03:32.803
FLEW INTO TOWER ONE OF THE

00:03:32.803 --> 00:03:35.039
WORLD TRADE CENTER. NOT LONG

00:03:35.039 --> 00:03:37.308
AFTER, FLIGHT 175 STRUCK TOWER

00:03:37.308 --> 00:03:39.143
TWO. WHILE THIS NEWS WAS

00:03:39.143 --> 00:03:41.178
BREAKING, A THIRD PLANE, FLIGHT

00:03:41.178 --> 00:03:43.781
77 CRASHED INTO THE PENTAGON.

00:03:43.781 --> 00:03:45.616
IN MY HOME STATE OF

00:03:45.616 --> 00:03:46.450
PENNSYLVANIA. A FOURTH FLIGHT

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.153
WAS AND WAS ON PATH TOWARDS OUR

00:03:49.153 --> 00:03:51.288
NATION'S CAPITAL. HOWEVER,

00:03:51.288 --> 00:03:52.489
BECAUSE OF THE COURAGEOUS

00:03:52.489 --> 00:03:54.191
PASSENGERS AND CREW OF THIS

00:03:54.191 --> 00:03:56.894
PLANE CRASHED IN A FIELD IN

00:03:56.894 --> 00:03:58.796
SHANKSVILLE, PENNSYLVANIA.

00:03:58.796 --> 00:04:00.497
SINCE THESE EVIL ATTACKS, OUR

00:04:00.497 --> 00:04:01.532
COUNTRY HAS JOINED TOGETHER TO

00:04:01.532 --> 00:04:03.133
COMMEMORATE THE COUNTLESS LIVES

00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:05.336
THAT WERE LOST THAT DAY. WE

00:04:05.336 --> 00:04:06.937
COME TOGETHER TO REMEMBER THE

00:04:06.937 --> 00:04:09.039
MEN, WOMEN, AND CHILDREN THAT

00:04:09.039 --> 00:04:10.774
DIED THAT DAY AND THE MANY

00:04:10.774 --> 00:04:12.009
FIRST RESPONDERS WHO WERE THERE

00:04:12.009 --> 00:04:14.144
TO HELP OTHERS, MANY OF WHOM

00:04:14.144 --> 00:04:16.513
NEVER CAME HOME THAT EVENING.

00:04:16.513 --> 00:04:17.715
WHILE TODAY'S WORLD HAS GROWN

00:04:17.715 --> 00:04:19.750
NO LESS DANGEROUS AND WE

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.052
CONTINUE TO GRAPPLE WITH EVIL,

00:04:22.052 --> 00:04:24.588
AMERICANS ARE RESILIENT. MAY

00:04:24.588 --> 00:04:26.140
GOD CONTINUE TO WATCH OVER OUR

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.092
FIRST RESPONDERS, MEMBERS OF

00:04:28.092 --> 00:04:29.426
OUR MILITARY, THEIR FAMILIES,

00:04:29.426 --> 00:04:31.996
AND ALL THOSE WHO LOST LOVED

00:04:31.996 --> 00:04:34.465
ONES DURING 911. THANK YOU, MR.

00:04:34.465 --> 00:04:35.499
SPEAKER, AND I YIELD BACK.

