00:04:46.443 --> 00:04:47.895
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: THANK YOU, MR.

00:04:47.895 --> 00:04:51.115
SPEAKER. TODAY I RISE TO PAY

00:04:51.115 --> 00:04:52.650
TRIBUTE TO A CHAMPION FOR

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.034
ENVIRONMENTAL PROTECTION.

00:04:54.034 --> 00:04:55.486
FORMER PENNSYLVANIA STATE

00:04:55.486 --> 00:04:57.521
SENATOR FRANKLIN CORY, WHOM I

00:04:57.521 --> 00:04:59.289
HAD THE PRIVILEGE OF MEETING.

00:04:59.289 --> 00:05:01.442
BORN AND RAISED IN CENTRAL

00:05:01.442 --> 00:05:02.643
PENNSYLVANIA, FRANKLIN CURRY

00:05:02.643 --> 00:05:05.045
PASSED AWAY ON AUGUST 16TH. HE

00:05:05.045 --> 00:05:07.831
WAS 89. A DEVOTED PUBLIC

00:05:07.831 --> 00:05:08.849
SERVANT, CURRY WAS FIRST

00:05:08.849 --> 00:05:10.367
ELECTED AS STATE REPRESENTATIVE

00:05:10.367 --> 00:05:12.403
IN NORTHUMBERLAND COUNTY BEFORE

00:05:12.403 --> 00:05:14.972
SERVING AS STATE SENATOR. HIS

00:05:14.972 --> 00:05:16.240
LASTING LEGACY WAS THE WRITING

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:18.242
AND PASSING OF OUR

00:05:18.242 --> 00:05:19.977
ENVIRONMENTAL RIGHTS AMENDMENT.

00:05:19.977 --> 00:05:22.513
ARTICLE ONE, SECTION 27 OF THE

00:05:22.513 --> 00:05:23.897
PENNSYLVANIA CONSTITUTION,

00:05:23.897 --> 00:05:25.883
WHICH GUARANTEES PENNSYLVANIANS

00:05:25.883 --> 00:05:28.185
THE RIGHT TO CLEAN AIR, PURE

00:05:28.185 --> 00:05:30.204
WATER AND THE PRESERVATION OF

00:05:30.204 --> 00:05:32.556
OUR NATURAL SCENIC AND HISTORIC

00:05:32.556 --> 00:05:34.425
ESTHETIC VALUES. IT AFFIRMS

00:05:34.425 --> 00:05:36.293
THAT PENNSYLVANIA'S NATURAL

00:05:36.293 --> 00:05:37.294
RESOURCES ARE THE COMMON

00:05:37.294 --> 00:05:38.595
PROPERTY OF OUR COMMONWEALTH,

00:05:38.595 --> 00:05:41.131
AND IT MAKES US, PENNSYLVANIANS

00:05:41.131 --> 00:05:42.633
AND LEGISLATORS, THE STEWARDS

00:05:42.633 --> 00:05:44.935
OF OUR ENVIRONMENT FOR

00:05:44.935 --> 00:05:46.970
GENERATIONS YET TO COME. EVERY

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.405
LEGISLATOR SUPPORTED IT.

00:05:48.405 --> 00:05:49.907
ARTICLE ONE, SECTION 27, WAS

00:05:49.907 --> 00:05:51.675
THE FIRST OF ITS KIND, THOUGH

00:05:51.675 --> 00:05:52.676
SEVERAL STATES HAVE NOW

00:05:52.676 --> 00:05:54.845
FOLLOWED CURRY'S LEAD. IT IS A

00:05:54.845 --> 00:05:56.613
TESTAMENT TO ITS CREATOR, WHO

00:05:56.613 --> 00:05:57.915
UNDERSTOOD THAT WE EACH HAVE

00:05:57.915 --> 00:06:00.651
THE RIGHT TO ENJOY, BUT BEAR A

00:06:00.651 --> 00:06:02.503
RESPONSIBILITY TO PASS ALONG A

00:06:02.503 --> 00:06:04.254
CLEAN, HEALTHY, SAFE

00:06:04.254 --> 00:06:05.723
ENVIRONMENT. MAY HIS MEMORY BE

00:06:05.723 --> 00:06:07.558
A BLESSING, AND MAY WE CONTINUE

00:06:07.558 --> 00:06:09.927
HIS UNWAVERING LOVE OF OUR

00:06:09.927 --> 00:06:11.695
PLANET. I YIELD BACK.

00:06:11.695 --> 00:06:12.362
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: GENTLEMAN YIELDS

00:06:12.362 --> 00:06:13.630
BACK. FOR WHAT PURPOSE DOES THE

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:16.867
GENTLEWOMAN FROM IOWA SEEK

00:06:16.867 --> 00:06:17.067
RECOGNITION?

00:06:17.067 --> 00:06:17.768
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: MR.

00:06:17.768 --> 00:06:19.937
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: PRESIDENT.

00:06:19.937 --> 00:06:20.621
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: WITHOUT OBJECTION,

00:06:20.621 --> 00:06:25.375
THE GENTLEWOMAN IS RECOGNIZED.

00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:26.944
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: MR. SPEAKER, 25

00:06:26.944 --> 00:06:28.378
YEARS AGO, ORDINARY PEOPLE

00:06:28.378 --> 00:06:29.847
KISSED THEIR FAMILIES GOODBYE

00:06:29.847 --> 00:06:31.765
AND WENT TO WORK. AS I WENT TO

00:06:31.765 --> 00:06:33.567
WORK AFTER MAKING MY CHILDREN'S

00:06:33.567 --> 00:06:35.319
LUNCH HEARING ON THE RADIO THAT

00:06:35.319 --> 00:06:37.221
A PLANE HAD FLOWN INTO TOWER

00:06:37.221 --> 00:06:38.589
ONE THINKING IT WAS A PRANK,

00:06:38.589 --> 00:06:40.274
AND BY THE TIME WE TURNED ON

00:06:40.274 --> 00:06:41.692
THE TV IN OUR WAITING ROOM, SAW

00:06:41.692 --> 00:06:43.560
THE SECOND PLANE HIT THE TOWER

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:44.828
AND KNEW WE HAD A TERRORIST

00:06:44.828 --> 00:06:46.363
ATTACK. OUR GENERATION'S PEARL

00:06:46.363 --> 00:06:48.732
HARBOR. A FATHER WHO CALLED HIS

00:06:48.732 --> 00:06:50.567
WIFE JUST TO SAY. I LOVE YOU

00:06:50.567 --> 00:06:52.469
ONE MORE TIME. A MOTHER WHO

00:06:52.469 --> 00:06:53.971
TUCKED A PHOTO OF HER KIDS INTO

00:06:53.971 --> 00:06:55.939
HER BAG THAT MORNING. AN IOWAN

00:06:55.939 --> 00:06:57.908
WHO IS IN HIS SECOND WEEK AT

00:06:57.908 --> 00:06:59.643
COLUMBIA, WHO GOES DOWN TO

00:06:59.643 --> 00:07:00.677
VOLUNTEER AND THEN ENLIST IN

00:07:00.677 --> 00:07:03.430
THE MILITARY. FIREFIGHTERS WHO

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:04.581
RAN UPSTAIRS WHILE EVERYONE

00:07:04.581 --> 00:07:06.433
ELSE WAS RUNNING DOWN BECAUSE

00:07:06.433 --> 00:07:08.685
THAT'S SIMPLY WHO THEY WERE.

00:07:08.685 --> 00:07:09.987
NEARLY 3000 OF THEM NEVER MADE

00:07:09.987 --> 00:07:11.955
IT HOME. AND IN THE QUIET THAT

00:07:11.955 --> 00:07:14.391
FOLLOWED, IN THE ASH AND THE

00:07:14.391 --> 00:07:16.126
SILENCE, SOMETHING HAPPENED

00:07:16.126 --> 00:07:17.995
THAT I STILL CARRY WITH ME.

00:07:17.995 --> 00:07:19.730
STRANGERS BECAME FAMILY. WE

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.698
HELD EACH OTHER. WE CRIED

00:07:21.698 --> 00:07:23.467
TOGETHER. AND FOR A MOMENT WE

00:07:23.467 --> 00:07:25.068
FORGOT EVERYTHING THAT DIVIDED

00:07:25.068 --> 00:07:26.937
US. I ENLISTED IN THE ARMY TO

00:07:26.937 --> 00:07:28.839
ENSURE RIGHTS FOR EVERYONE,

00:07:28.839 --> 00:07:29.840
REGARDLESS OF WHETHER THEY

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.643
DISAGREE WITH ME. AND 25 YEARS

00:07:32.643 --> 00:07:34.178
LATER, I STILL THINK ABOUT THE

00:07:34.178 --> 00:07:35.612
FAMILIES WHO SET AN EXTRA PLACE

00:07:35.612 --> 00:07:36.814
AT THE TABLE THAT WILL ALWAYS

00:07:36.814 --> 00:07:38.615
BE EMPTY. THE CHILDREN WHO GREW

00:07:38.615 --> 00:07:40.584
UP WITHOUT A PARENT, THEIR

00:07:40.584 --> 00:07:42.152
GRIEF BECAME OUR GRIEF. AND IT

00:07:42.152 --> 00:07:44.621
STILL IS. WE PROMISE TO NEVER

00:07:44.621 --> 00:07:47.157
FORGET. I WILL NEVER FORGET

00:07:47.157 --> 00:07:48.926
THEM. I WILL ALWAYS DEFEND THEM.

00:07:48.926 --> 00:07:50.794
AND WE MUST NEVER FORGET THAT

00:07:50.794 --> 00:07:53.197
THOSE WHO HARM US, WE WILL NOT

00:07:53.197 --> 00:07:54.331
FORGET. WITH THAT, MR. SPEAKER,

00:07:54.331 --> 00:07:55.365
I YIELD BACK.

00:07:55.365 --> 00:07:55.966
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: GENTLEMAN YIELDS

00:07:55.966 --> 00:07:57.467
BACK. FOR WHAT PURPOSE DOES THE

00:07:57.467 --> 00:07:58.869
GENTLEMAN FROM RHODE ISLAND

00:07:58.869 --> 00:08:06.543
SEEK RECOGNITION?

00:08:06.543 --> 00:08:07.678
UNIDENTIFIED SPEAKER: MR. SPEAKER, I RISE

00:08:07.678 --> 00:08:10.547
TODAY TO RECOGNIZE THE 25TH

00:08:10.547 --> 00:08:11.682
ANNIVERSARY OF THE SEPTEMBER

00:08:11.682 --> 00:08:13.383
11TH ATTACKS TO HONOR THE

00:08:13.383 --> 00:08:15.552
NEARLY 3000 AMERICANS WE LOST

00:08:15.552 --> 00:08:18.121
